WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.694 --> 00:00:07.321
Three days left.

2
00:00:07.321 --> 00:00:16.678
Four reviews in, none answered.

3
00:00:16.678 --> 00:00:22.038
And what auto-reply would have written, on one of their own reviews.

4
00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:35.027
What the trial got them, and what stops.

5
00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:46.427
Nine days later. Four more reviews, nobody watching.

6
00:00:46.427 --> 00:00:52.331
So the win-back says exactly that.
